# The root help lists the command groups, the version flag reports the
# version, and an unknown command is refused.
exec aigw --help
cmp stdout help.txt
normalize stderr help.err
! grep . help.err

exec aigw --version
cmp stdout version.txt

exitcode 1 aigw nothing
cmp stdout unknown.txt

-- help.txt --
AIGW  Command help
────────────────────────────────────────
  Local AI provider configuration, routing, and diagnostics

Start with one path
  aigw setup                          Connect the first account
  aigw use <client> <provider/model>  Point a client at a model
  aigw check                          Check enabled clients (may use quota)

Usage
  aigw [flags]
  aigw [command]

Connect
  setup                Complete first-time setup

Use every day
  check                Check enabled clients; selected-model probes may use quota
  rotate               Update one Account Token
  status               Show each client's model and local readiness
  use                  Point a client at a model

Recover
  doctor               Show detailed diagnostics for configuration, secrets, and adapters
  install              Install this portable AIGW executable
  repair               Discover and repair client configuration
  rollback             Restore configuration and client projections, not the program
  sync                 Resynchronize client configuration
  uninstall            Withdraw managed projections and remove a portable program
  update               Update or roll back the portable AIGW program

Advanced
  account              Manage account endpoints and optional precise diagnostics
  add                  Add and connect one Account with its first Route
  balance              Show account balance and token quota
  catalog              Discover authenticated model catalogs for each account (compact summary by default)
  client               List, enable, disable and edit clients
  completion           Generate shell completion
  config               Import and export configuration
  installation         Inspect the current portable program and retained predecessor
  model                List, search, show, add, edit and remove models
  models               Compare configured model IDs with provider catalogs; does not test inference
  provider             List, show, add, edit and remove providers; rotate Tokens; report balances
  route                Manage Routes
  test                 Probe selected endpoints without model inference
  verify               Verify a Route through a real native client (may use quota)

Options
  -h, --help      show help
  -v, --version   show version
-- version.txt --
aigw version 0.1.0-dev
-- unknown.txt --
AIGW  Action required
────────────────────────────────────────

Problem
  unknown command "nothing"

Fix
  aigw --help
